e Feature Store | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P1 |\n34\t| RHAISTRAT-9006-E007 | Feature Store documentation: enablement, getting started, supported limits | Implementation | RHOAI Documentation | P1 |\n35\t\n36\tConditional branches (not standalone Jira issues; attached to the gating\n37\tInvestigation as a plan document):\n38\t\n39\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n40\t|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n41\t| RHAISTRAT-9006-BRANCH-A-E008 | Productize the operator-based Feast deployment (Branch A) | Implementation | RHOAI Feature Store | P0 |\n42\t| RHAISTRAT-9006-BRANCH-A-E009 | Platform Operator enablement for Feature Store, operator topology (Branch A) | Implementation | RHOAI Platform Operator | P0 |\n43\t| RHAISTRAT-9006-BRANCH-B-E008 | Productize the standalone per-project Feast server (Branch B) | Implementation | RHOAI Feature Store | P0 |\n44\t| RHAISTRAT-9006-BRANCH-B-E009 | Platform Operator enablement for Feature Store, standalone topology (Branch B) | Implementation | RHOAI Platform Operator | P0 |\n45\t\n46\t`epic_count` = 11 (7 main-plan epics + 4 branch epics). Main-plan critical path\n47\tlength = 3 (e.g., license-validation → workbench SDK image → documentation;\n48\tequally, topology decision → Dashboard integration → documentation, and in each\n49\tbranch: topology decision → deployment → Platform Operator enablement).\n50\t\n51\t## Dependency DAG\n52\t\n53\t```mermaid\n54\tgraph TD\n55\t    E001[\"E001 Investigation: topology decision\"]\n56\t    E002[\"E002 repo-onboarding\"]\n57\t    E003[\"E003 license-validation\"]\n58\t    E004[\"E004 konflux-onboarding\"]\n59\t    E005[\"E005 workbench Feast SDK image\"]\n60\t    E006[\"E006 Dashboard integration\"]\n61\t    E007[\"E007 documentation\"]\n62\t    A008[\"Branch A E008: operator-based deployment\"]\n63\t    A009[\"Branch A E009: Platform Operator enablement (operator)\"]\n64\t    B008[\"Branch B E008: standalone per-project server\"]\n65\t    B009[\"Branch B E009: Platfor