{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8142764ee84f42fd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9006-E005\n3\ttitle: Feast SDK preinstalled in a supported workbench image\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9006\n5\tcomponent: Notebooks\n6\tteam: RHOAI Notebooks\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9006-E003\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 0\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: 1\n17\t  external_dependency: 0\n18\t  human_process_gates: 0\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 1\n21\timplementation_type: null\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 6\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Feast SDK preinstalled in a supported workbench image\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tMake the feature store reachable from data science workbenches: preinstall the\n35\tFeast SDK in at least one supported RHOAI workbench image, so data scientists\n36\tcan connect to the feature store from a notebook without manual pip installs.\n37\tThis covers the workbench-image side of workbench reachability; the feature\n38\tstore itself is deployed and enabled through separate efforts.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Select the supported workbench image (or images) that will carry the Feast\n43\t  SDK preinstalled, following existing workbench image conventions.\n44\t- Add the Feast SDK and its required dependencies to the selected image\n45\t  build, at a version compatible with the productized Feature Store release\n46\t  baseline.\n47\t- Verify the SDK installs cleanly in the image build (dependency resolution,\n48\t  no conflicts with the image's existing package set) and that import works\n49\t  in a running workbench.\n50\t- Document the SDK version carried in each affected image.\n51\t\n52\tOut of scope: Feast server/operator deployment and Platform Operator\n53\tenablement, and any feature-authoring UI (Dashboard presence is a separate\n54\teffort).\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- At least one supported workbench image ships with the Feast SDK\n59\t  preinstalled; the image and SDK version are documented.\n60\t- The SDK imports successfully and basic client operations can be initiated\n61\t  from a running workbench of that image against a feature store endpoint.\n62\t- The SDK version is compatible with the productized Feast release baseline\n63\t  selected for the midstream repository.\n64\t- The package addition does not regress the existing workbench image test\n65\t  suite.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-2 (P1): \"Data scientists can reach the feature store from workbenches\n70\t  with the Feast SDK preinstalled in at least one supported workbench image.\"\n71\t\n72\t## Dependencies and Constraints\n73\t\n74\t- License clearance for the Feast SDK and its transitive dependencies must\n75\t  complete before the image contents are finalized; if licenses fail, the\n76\t  dependency set changes and this epic's scope is rewritten.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99844f8dcd6181fd","agent_id":"ab358d42db6678f9b","session_id":"ad59e9b5-006d-46b0-9f8c-0292979aa557","uuid":"d2948dcc-b3df-479b-b20b-f218b25e953f","timestamp":"2026-10-08T16:36:49.042Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8142764ee84f42fd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
